### Step 4 — The powder stock form

1. In `AddStockSheet.tsx`, add `{ value: "bulk_powder", label: "Powder" }` to
   `TYPES`. **Remove the `hint` field from the type entirely** and drop the
   subtext from all four entries.
1a. Resolve the compound's form before first render and open the sheet on it —
   `formsForId` already returns the candidate list, so seed the selected form
